gruvoc small-vols: Report cells with smallest volumes

USAGE

    $ gruvoc small-vols [I] [OPTIONS]

ARGUMENTS

    I: Name of input volume mesh file

OPTIONS

    --help
        Print this help message and exit

    -i IFILE
        Name of input volume mesh file

    --mapbc, --mapbcfile MAPBCFILE
        Use .mapbc file to name surface components

    --nrows, -n N
        Number of small-volume cells to include in report {25}

    --smallvol VOLUME
        Volume cutoff below which to report individual cells
